cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use Thyra, please cite the Nature Methods paper below. If your work
  relies on how Thyra reads vendor files or keeps memory bounded while
  converting, please also cite the JASMS paper listed under references.
title: "Thyra"
abstract: >-
  Thyra converts mass spectrometry imaging data from imzML, mzPeak and vendor
  formats into the SpatialData format, keeping ion mobility and MS/MS data.
type: software
authors:
